+Canonicalization. Vertex relabeling and both edge orderings are the full
+presentation symmetries applied by the generator. Within this promised family,
+the tuple (n,c,m,r) is recovered from incidence counts and is a complete
+isomorphism invariant; the key never uses the seed or rendered text.
+""".strip()
